# After Pass 2 — re-check ranks

Pass 2 is implemented (`ASSESSMENT_OVERLAY_LLM`, default on): a **personal narrator** over book constraints. Market Pass 1 stays Action authority except hard trigger (Hold→Watch nudge allowed).

When overlay outputs change SAI Action / Confidence / rationale:

1. Re-check Tax & Trim pool order; Buy Plan Score-mode qualification; Sell Rank vs Proximity; Screening Action mix and Attention `!`.
2. Expect **little formula change**. Conf-soften and Hold→Watch can still reshuffle lists that read SAI.
3. Feed Pass 2 harvest **facts**, not Trim/Loss scores as a competing Action. Details: `docs/SIGNAL_SCORES.md` (§ After Pass 2).
